off, who's close and who's out.","published":"2026-11-25T03:24:30.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50575185/cfp-playoff-2026-bubble-watch-week-fourth-ranking","type":"Story","byline":"Heather Dinich","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Why UTEP-NIU is 2026's most unglamorous Game of the Century","description":"The Week 13 game will mark the first time since at least 2000 that two teams that are winless against FBS opponents will meet in their final week of the regular season.","published":"2026-11-25T01:19:39.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50587546/utep-niu-college-football-game-century","type":"Story","byline":"J.J. Post","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Indiana falls from 12-team field in 4th CFP rankings; Horns, Vols leap Bama","description":"Defending champ Indiana fell six spots to No. 14, while Alabama was leaped by Texas and Tennessee and fell out of the top five in the latest CFP rankings Tuesday night.","published":"2026-11-25T07:42:16.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50588082/indiana-top-12-cfp-rankings-texas-tennessee-leap-alabama","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Andrea Adelson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Who's on the move? CFP committee's fourth top 25 and bracket of 2026","description":"A look at the new bracket based on the College Football Playoff committee's fourth set of rankings.","published":"2026-11-25T02:02:59.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50584328/cfp-2026-fourth-committee-top-25-bracket","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"LSU asks judge to throw out SEC's 'unwarranted' suit against Tigers","description":"LSU is asking a federal judge to dismiss the SEC's lawsuit against the Tigers, arguing that many of the plaintiffs in the case are protected by sovereign immunity as state officials and that the league doesn't have jurisdiction.","published":"2026-11-25T05:10:29.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50588015/lsu-asks-judge-throw-sec-unwarranted-suit-tigers","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Mark Schlabach","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Sources: Stanford quarterback Davis Warren returning in 2027","description":"Davis Warren has agreed to return to the Cardinal for his final year of eligibility, sources said.","published":"2026-11-25T01:32:09.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50588012/stanford-quarterback-davis-warren-returning-2027","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Pete Thamel","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Wyoming's Jay Sawvel gets self-imposed 1-game ban over tampering violations","description":"Wyoming coach Jay Sawvel will serve a one-game suspension Saturday as part of the school's self-imposed penalties for impermissible contacting of players.","published":"2026-11-25T00:01:51.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50586972/wyoming-coach-jay-sawvel-gets-self-imposed-1-game-suspension","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4875126/horace-lockett","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Horace_Lockett"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Horace Lockett","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Horace_Lockett","description":"American football player (born 2004)","touched":"2026-11-14T07:38:20Z","intro":"Horace Lockett (born July 26, 2004) is an American college football defensive tackle for the UCF Knights. He previously played for the Georgia Tech Yellow Jackets.","sections":[{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"As a true freshman at Georgia Tech in 2022, Lockett made three appearances. He saw more playing time in the 2023 season and tallied 25 tackles along with 2.5 tackles-for-loss (TFLs) and a forced fumble. However, a hand injury resulted in Lockett being kept out of every game during the 2024 season. The following year, he transferred to the UCF Knights. With UCF, Lockett won a starting role and posted 13 tackles, three TFLs, a sack and two pass breakups. However, a pectoral injury ended his season after four games. Lockett returned for a final season with the Knights in 2026."}]}}